WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — jouleos (45s) Narrator Bobby

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:07.061
First, today's computers stack many separate layers, and AI agents are bolted on top unchanged.

2
00:00:07.501 --> 00:00:13.958
Second, none of those layers asks beforehand how much energy an agent's action will actually spend.

3
00:00:14.398 --> 00:00:21.294
Third, an agent machine must measure energy, enforce strict budgets, and refuse actions that break them.

4
00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:25.810
Wrapping a new policy sandbox around a fifty-year-old kernel is like

5
00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:30.546
putting a turnstile in front of an unmetered power plant. Counting milliseconds

6
00:00:30.546 --> 00:00:34.742
or instructions treats idle waiting and a full GPU burst as identical.

7
00:00:35.182 --> 00:00:39.948
The Search for Joule Operating System sets ten checkable architectural rules and

8
00:00:39.948 --> 00:00:45.668
verifies a three-hundred-ten-test Rust reference spine that reserves budgets before actions run.
